{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shuruka Boxing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the ring and experience the most <strong>realistic first-person boxing simulation</strong> ever created. <strong>Shuruka Boxing</strong> puts you in the gloves of a rising champion, fighting your way to the top in brutal, high-stakes matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Hyper-Realistic Combat</strong> \u2013 Every punch, dodge, and block feels <strong>authentic</strong>, thanks to advanced physics and motion-captured animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Dynamic AI Opponents</strong> \u2013 Face off against fighters with unique styles, adaptive strategies, and brutal finishing moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Career Mode</strong> \u2013 Train, rise through the ranks, and challenge legendary fighters for championship glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to become the undisputed champion?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2448900?t=1744131044","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448900/8af3fca4c66a2c24db7cf00f10cbf727d8960c75/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744131044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448900/22f89a71e220f1d84042f6af3f29696fcd4e94bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744131044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448900/22f89a71e220f1d84042f6af3f29696fcd4e94bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744131044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3606460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shuruka Boxing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph